# REQ-001 — Runtime Profile Adapter Layer with AWS and On-Prem Parity

## Scope

REQ-001 implements a profile-selected adapter layer that provides identical port interfaces for five infrastructure concerns:

| Port | AWS Adapter | On-Prem Adapter |
|------|-------------|-----------------|
| Object Storage | S3 (boto3) | MinIO (minio SDK) |
| Queue | SQS (boto3) | Redis Lists |
| Eventing | SNS (boto3) | Redis Pub/Sub |
| Secrets | Secrets Manager (boto3) | Env vars / JSON file |
| Log Sink | CloudWatch Logs (boto3) | Local JSONL files |

Profile selection is driven by the `DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE` environment variable (`aws` or `onprem`). No code changes are required to switch profiles.

## Emitted Files

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `src/feature/ports.py` | Port interfaces (5 runtime-checkable Protocols) |
| `src/feature/object_storage.py` | AWS + on-prem object storage adapters |
| `src/feature/queue.py` | AWS + on-prem queue adapters |
| `src/feature/eventing.py` | AWS + on-prem eventing adapters |
| `src/feature/secrets.py` | AWS + on-prem secrets adapters |
| `src/feature/log_sink.py` | AWS + on-prem log sink adapters |
| `src/feature/registry.py` | Profile-aware registry builder + parity validator |
| `src/feature/adapter_contract.py` | Backward-compatible re-export module |
| `src/feature/shared_adapters.py` | Singleton registry entry point (importable as `shared.adapters`) |
| `src/feature/__init__.py` | Package init |
| `test/feature/test_req_behavior.py` | Unit + integration tests |
| `test/feature/__init__.py` | Test package init |
| `test/conftest.py` | Pytest markers and path setup |
